[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578608269","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101306#issuecomment-2578608269","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101306","id":2578608269,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZsnCN","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T20:34:47Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T20:34:47Z","body":"This was an intentional change to the shortcuts. `Enter` and `Tab` now both replace text (`ui_text_completion_replace`) and `Shift+Enter` and `Shift+Tab` now insert text(`ui_text_completion_accept`). You can change the shortcuts for different behavior.\n\n- see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90723","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578608269/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2627067286","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101306#issuecomment-2627067286","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101306","id":2627067286,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cld2W","user":{"login":"miv391","id":49998025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTk4MDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49998025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391","html_url":"https://github.com/miv391","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T12:14:08Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T12:14:08Z","body":"This is quite bad with code like this:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tInput.is_action_just_pressed()\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar s = \"123\"\n\tpass\n```\n\n\n1. Start typing the action name to the `is_action_just_pressed()` function (goal being `Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"ui_accept\")`) by pressing `\"` key  -> auto completion dropdown opens\n1. Press tab \n\n=> Auto completion removes everything until the next `\"` character:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tInput.is_action_just_pressed(\"ui_accept\"123\"\n\tpass\n```\n\nThe \"replaced word\" is apparently considered being from the typed `\"` character to the next `\"` character, no matter how far away it is. Is there any reason for auto complete to operate on multiple lines?\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2627067286/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628336473","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101306#issuecomment-2628336473","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101306","id":2628336473,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cqTtZ","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T20:21:47Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T20:21:47Z","body":"- For the multiline string issue, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/94086 instead\n\nI believe this issue can be closed as intentional?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628336473/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2639628008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101306#issuecomment-2639628008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101306","id":2639628008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dVYbo","user":{"login":"NitramiuZ","id":67265963,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjY1OTYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67265963?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ","html_url":"https://github.com/NitramiuZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NitramiuZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-06T11:59:49Z","updated_at":"2025-02-06T11:59:49Z","body":"I noticed this too in 4.4, good that you can change the behavior.\n\nMy question is when this is the intention of the programmer?\nWhen would you start typing in the middle of a word and wanting the whole thing replaced?\n\nI think this is something that will trip up many people switching to 4.4, what's wrong with the current behavior?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2639628008/reactions","total_count":13,"+1":13,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes